B.Ss=new A.L("Busy City","The city is full of people. Kiko remembers: stay polite in the city too.","Be polite anywhere \u2014 not only at home.",B.a5)
B.X0=new A.L("Red Light","The light is still red. Many are in a hurry, but Kiko waits.","Wait your turn patiently \u2014 rules keep everyone safe.",B.a5)
B.Uq=new A.L("Crosswalk","Cross the street at the right spot, look left and right.","Follow road rules \u2014 it keeps you and others safe.",B.a5)
B.Um=new A.L("Bus Queue","The bus stop is crowded. Kiko queues neatly, no cutting in.","Queue in order \u2014 fair, and comfy for all.",B.a5)
B.Ui=new A.L("Sorting Bins","The city has colorful bins for sorting trash.","Sort your trash \u2014 a clean city starts with one step.",B.a_)
B.Td=new A.L("City Library","Kiko borrows a book. Note the return date carefully.","Return it on time \u2014 others want to read it too.",B.b9)
B.Tu=new A.L("Forgotten Book","A friend left a book on the bench. Kiko knows whose it is.","Return others' things \u2014 no matter how small.",B.b9)
B.Ue=new A.L("Extra Change","The shopkeeper gives too much change by mistake. Kiko notices.","Extra is not your luck \u2014 return it honestly.",B.b9)
B.Wz=new A.L("Dropped Money","Rp10,000 fell on the sidewalk. Kiko knows whose it is.","What is not yours, return it. Honesty makes you rich.",B.b9)
B.T1=new A.L("Honest Seller","The seller weighs her goods honestly and exactly.","Support the honest \u2014 buy from those who weigh fairly.",B.b9)
B.Vt=new A.L("City Park","The park is green and cool. Do not step on the grass or pick flowers.","Care for public places like your own home.",B.a_)
B.UK=new A.L("Lost Child","A little child cries looking for their mom. Walk them to the guard post.","Help those in trouble \u2014 do not ignore them in a crowd.",B.G)
B.VG=new A.L("The Guard","The guard watches the building all day. Greet and thank him.","Appreciate those who keep you safe.",B.ad)
B.TN=new A.L("Save Power","The classroom light is on but the room is empty. Kiko turns it off.","Save power and water \u2014 the Earth and the bill thank you.",B.a5)
B.Ta=new A.L("Honest in a Test","The test is hard. Kiko could peek, but chooses to be honest.","A grade from cheating is empty \u2014 honesty makes you proud.",B.b9)
B.Sz=new A.L("A Friend's Promise","Kiko promised to play at 4. Arriving on time keeps the promise.","Keep small promises \u2014 people learn to trust you.",B.b9)
B.Vc=new A.L("Careless Litter","Someone drops trash on the street. Kiko picks it up and bins it right.","Set a good example \u2014 do not follow the wrong.",B.a_)
B.Un=new A.L("Pedicab Driver","Pak Dimas the pedicab driver works hard. Pay the right fare.","Pay what you promised \u2014 a small but important promise.",B.b9)
B.W2=new A.L("Sharing Lunch","A friend forgot their lunch. Kiko shares his.","Share with those in need \u2014 the heart grows rich.",B.G)
B.TH=new A.L("A Seat for Grandma","The bus is full. An old lady is standing. Kiko gives his seat.","Give your seat to the old and weak \u2014 that is polite.",B.ad)
B.Wr=new A.L("Honesty Shop","A small shop with no clerk. Pay and take your change yourself.","Honest when no one watches \u2014 that is true honesty.",B.b9)
B.UR=new A.L("Found Wallet","Kiko finds a wallet with money. Report it to the officer.","A valuable find is not yours \u2014 report it.",B.b9)
B.T3=new A.L("Group Work","The school task is split into groups. Share the work fairly.","Everyone does their part \u2014 that is fair and light.",B.a5)
B.Wc=new A.L("Clean the City River","The people work together to clear trash from the city river.","A clean river means a healthy city. Pitch in too.",B.a_)
B.V9=new A.L("Thank the Workers","The cleaners work at dawn. Kiko says thank you.","Appreciate others' work with sincere words.",B.ad)
B.UN=new A.L("Honest City Kid","The last day in the city. The final boss awaits!","A good city means honest people. Start with yourself.",B.b9)
