B.UB=new A.L("Colorful Fish","Colorful fish swim in the reef. Look, do not chase.","Enjoy the beauty without disturbing \u2014 that is respect.",B.G)
B.WX=new A.L("Drifting Trash","Trash from the river reaches the sea. Where does it come from?","Trash on land ends up in the sea \u2014 bin it right.",B.a_)
