B.UT=new A.L("Mangrove Roots","The mangrove forest is where little fish hide and grow.",u.N,B.G)
B.Vp=new A.L("Ghost Net","An old net is snagged on the coral, putting fish in danger.","Remove the dangerous \u2014 save many small lives.",B.a_)
B.Tb=new A.L("Murky Water","The sea is murky from land waste. The fish can hardly breathe.","Care for the water at home \u2014 the sea stays clean too.",B.a_)
B.Vh=new A.L("Blue Whale","A giant blue whale passes slowly. Give it room and admire it.","The big need not be feared \u2014 just respected.",B.G)
B.TL=new A.L("Microplastic","Plastic breaks into tiny bits, eaten by fish by accident.","Use less single-use plastic \u2014 start with your lunch.",B.a_)
B.VV=new A.L("Sick Reef","The coral reef turns white from dirty water. Let us help it heal!","Clean seawater means healthy coral. Start at home.",B.a_)
B.X3=new A.L("Stingray","The stingray glides gracefully like it is floating. Just look.","Admire from afar \u2014 do not touch the wild.",B.a5)
B.SU=new A.L("Dolphins Help","Dolphins help their hurt friend rise to the surface.","Even animals help each other \u2014 how much more should we.",B.G)
B.Vb=new A.L("Shipwreck","An old shipwreck becomes a new home for many fish.","From the broken, new life can be born.",B.G)
B.UP=new A.L("Wise Fisherman","The fisherman takes just enough fish and spares the small ones.","Take just enough \u2014 leave some for tomorrow.",B.a5)
B.So=new A.L("Light in the Deep","In the deepest sea, the fish glow on their own. Magical!","There is always beauty, even in the darkest place.",B.G)
B.Sr=new A.L("Beach Trash","Trash on the beach is carried by waves to the open sea.","Clean the beach \u2014 you protect the whole sea.",B.a_)
B.Wf=new A.L("Old Turtle","An old turtle has roamed the oceans. It leaves a message: protect the sea.","Heed the old \u2014 they have seen so much.",B.ad)
B.Vq=new A.L("Reef Heals","The coral you cared for turns colorful and healthy again!","Small effort each day brings a big result.",B.a_)
B.T7=new A.L("School of Fish","Thousands of fish swim together again. The sea is alive!","When the home is clean, the dwellers come home.",B.G)
B.Sd=new A.L("Sea Researcher","The researcher studies the sea so it can be better protected.","Appreciate scientists \u2014 they work for our nature.",B.ad)
B.V_=new A.L("Cleanup Dive","Kiko and the team dive to collect trash from the sea floor.","Working together cleans the sea faster.",B.a_)
B.SR=new A.L("Shining Sea","The water is clear again, the coral healthy, the fish lively. Lovely!","This is the gift of caring: a healthy nature.",B.G)
B.U2=new A.L("Sea Hero","The last day in the deep ocean. The final boss awaits!","A healthy sea means a healthy Earth. Care for rivers, care for the sea.",B.a_)
