B.WU=new A.L("Liftoff","Kiko rides a rocket into space! Almost there.","Great things start with one brave step.",B.G)
B.TU=new A.L("Astronaut Team","In the rocket, each astronaut has a job. Kiko holds his part.","A team is strong when everyone does their job.",B.a5)
B.Uf=new A.L("Zero Gravity","Things float in space. Tidy them up so nothing gets lost.","Be neat and orderly \u2014 wherever you are.",B.a5)
B.T_=new A.L("Earth from Above","From the window, Earth looks small, blue, and beautiful.","Earth is our only home \u2014 take good care of it.",B.G)
B.Tc=new A.L("Moon Footprint","A footprint on the moon can last thousands of years. Step carefully.","Every step leaves a mark \u2014 choose the good ones.",B.a5)
